# Native library names declared by this module (one per line).
# The daemon reads lib/arm64-v8a/libvector_duckusb.so out of this APK into sealed SharedMemory
# and Vector's soLoader links it, then calls its exported native_init(NativeAPIEntries*) from a
# module-class context. System.loadLibrary() is never used and would not work: soLoader maps the
# image anonymously and never registers it with the Android linker.
libvector_duckusb.so
